Here is the commit message:
OOZIE-2553 Cred tag is required for all actions in the
 workflow even if an action does not require it (me.venkatr via rohini)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the handling of the `cred` attribute in workflow actions, where the absence of a cred tag was not properly managed. Specifically, the code was allowing the `cred` variable to be set to the string value `"null"` instead of an actual null value, leading to potential misinterpretation of whether credentials were required or present. This could result in actions being executed without the necessary credential information, violating the requirement that all actions must have a cred tag.

